class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yeah! Every morning I see him at the cafe. I'll try that."}], "audiosrc": "engenn4le18ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le18ob11re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Vanessa's Part-Time Job", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "These Are the Days", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 18, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Expressions of Frequency", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use expressions of frequency to say how many times you do a task per period of time (day/week/month).", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You ask the question:   How often do you ... ? ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Expressions of Frequency\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Examples\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"every ... (day of the week)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Every Monday, we have a team meeting in the office. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on ... (day of the week) nights\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We hold a video conference with other branch offices on Wednesdays. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"once (= one time) a week \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The staff goes out for lunch once a week. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"twice (= two times) a week\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I report to the manager twice a week. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"(#) times a month\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We complete a project report two times a month. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: How often do you write a report?<br /> <span class=\"strong\">Sam</span>: Once a week. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Asking for Information and Clarifications", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "We ask for more information to know more about how a friend's life is going. Sometimes we need to ask for targeted clarification.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Asking About Work\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Asking for Targeted Clarification\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"How are things at ________?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Tell me more.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" How's work going for you?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Can you be more specific?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" How do you like your job?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Oh, yeah? Like what?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"content": "engenn4le18ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to familiarize", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to get to know the content of something well", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: I have to familiarize myself with lots of new recipes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le18ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words to review.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to catch on", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to become better at a new process of work ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm really catching on to the new routines at work.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le18ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "That's good to hear ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "That's good news!/I'm happy to hear that!", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">Albert</span>: I'm learning a lot of interesting things at work.  <br/><span class=\"strong\">Annette</span>: That's good to hear.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le18ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "satisfying ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "making you feel good or giving you what you want or need   ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I find my work in helping clients very satisfying.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le18ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "productive", "type": "name"}, {"content": "getting a lot of work done in a certain amount of time ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have to be productive at my desk to get a lot done.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le18ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "pressure", "type": "name"}, {"content": "stress and demands from work or daily life", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Sometimes I get a lot of pressure from my boss.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le18ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Create 5 - 8 casual questions to ask a colleague about family, leisure, work. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write each question on a card.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask him or her to draw from your cards and try to answer each question.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I use expression of frequency to write questions about routines.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask questions to a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I answer casual questions and provide clear information.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}